full_desc:
Разработка маркетплейса с:
- каталогом товаров и фильтров;
- системой отзывов и рейтингов;
- интеграцией с логистическими службами;
- личным кабинетом продавца;
- аналитикой продаж.

Нужны full‑stack разработчики, маркетологи, специалисты по UX.

Full-featured e-commerce platform development:
- Product catalog with search and filters;
- Shopping cart and checkout flow;
- Payment gateway integration (Stripe/PayPal);
- User accounts with order history;
- Admin dashboard for inventory management.

Tech stack: Python, Django, PostgreSQL, React.

Project to build complete DevOps infrastructure:
- Infrastructure as Code (Terraform);
- CI/CD pipelines with GitHub Actions;
- Docker containerization and Kubernetes orchestration;
- Monitoring with Prometheus and Grafana;
- Log aggregation with ELK stack.

Tech stack: Python, Docker, AWS, PostgreSQL.
